      "key": [
        "Tamsin",
        "Tamsin Dray"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Tamsin Dray",
      "content": "Tamsin Dray is a Saltgate courier, known for carrying the Morrow letters through a blockade without ever being caught. Captain Mora Quill hired her to carry the Saltwind Chart to Kestrel Lighthouse, where she struck the Lighthouse Bargain with Brother Saul. She later walked into the Magistrate's hall posing as a courier and freed Ines Vell from the cells.",
