      "comment": "Mora Quill",
      "content": "Captain Mora Quill commands the ship Gull's Errand and wears a salt-stiff blue coat. She hired Tamsin Dray to carry the Saltwind Chart. Her warehouse burned in the Harbor Fire. She planned Ines Vell's rescue with the Lamplighters' Guild and sailed the Gull's Errand out past the harbor chain.",
