    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Hale",
        "Oren Hale",
        "Captain Hale",
        "Captain"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Oren Hale",
      "content": "Captain Oren Hale is a tall harbor watch captain with a burned right hand. He serves Magistrate Kesh but let Tamsin Dray go on the docks and worked the pumps during the Harbor Fire. Kesh moved him to the cell guard as punishment. He unlocked Ines Vell's cell and asked Tamsin to strike him so that Kesh would have a story.",
