    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Brother Saul",
        "Saul"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Brother Saul",
      "content": "Brother Saul is the old monk who keeps the lamp at Kestrel Lighthouse; his beard is stained with lamp oil. He hid the Saltwind Chart in the lamp room in exchange for Tamsin carrying his letter to the Lamplighters' Guild (the Lighthouse Bargain). He knew the cartographer's name but had sworn not to speak it. [Edited by hand: Saul is never to be shown leaving the lighthouse.]",
