      "key": [
        "Drowned Lantern"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The Drowned Lantern",
      "content": "The Drowned Lantern is the lowest tavern in Saltgate. Its floor tilts toward the harbor, it is tended by Pell the barkeep, and a hatch in its cellar opens onto the docks. Captain Mora Quill hired Tamsin Dray in its corner booth.",
